  "review_evidence": "Own independently sealed primary50 and exact StatementSeal50 reused explicitly; 49 accepted source-only prefix strictly byte/structure reused, not proof history. All90 original pins rechecked current raw/LF. All533 selected rows,63 fragment/provider byte ranges,13 new balanced HTML anchors and595 caller entries checked. New route sound as source prerequisite subject to two precisely typed missing definition-dependency representations; no mathematical/binder/formula blocker identified.",
  "semantic_slots": {
    "objects": "Actual Gibbs mu/joint J/outer nu; reflection Lambda/F; original L2 projection P/U and authored A=PUP, B=(1-P)UP,D=(1-P)U(1-P). Source block notations remain U_PP/U_QP/U_QQ; aliases disclosed.",
    "domains": "True finite-real-Hilbert/Borel including rank0 representation extension; source Euclidean smooth compact signed f, actual nu L2 representatives and gradient/variance output domains; no public output certificates.",
    "quantifiers": "Source V/C2/curvature/positive eta with beta*eta<=1; R/S/U produced before all smooth compact f. AE kernel uniqueness only transports law/mean/L2 classes, never identifies every-y kernels or differentiability versions.",
    "assumptions": "Only sealed source assumptions; probability, disintegration, reflected law, U pullback and all domains internally produced using three opaque genuine producer headers. No f-centering/nontrivial/H1/Gamma certificate.",
    "conclusions": "Exact block identities and macro norm gap; actual variance=norm Bg squared; source sharp eta gradient energy bound. Whole-space star B B=P-A squared distinguished from source restricted-range I-U_PP squared.",
    "scope_and_senses": "Source-only prerequisite topology; internally required sameS/sameU/meanlift/normtransport adapters represented. Smooth class only; rough allL2->H1/B13 literal Gamma/outerclosure/halfturn/main/cost remain excluded.",
    "constants": "Exact source alpha/beta/eta and sharp49 coefficient retained; reflection quarter scaling preserved; no source binder or numeric delta identified."
  },
